## Atlas authorization (required)

Before any destructive, production, deploy, credential or spending action:

1. Call `atlas_authorize` with agent `agent:claude`, principal `user:YOU`,
   delegation_chain `["grt_XXXXXXXXXXXX"]`, the requested_action (e.g. `db.delete`)
   and EVERY effect (type, resource, environment).
2. Proceed only if decision is `permit`. On `deny`, stop and tell the user the reason.
   On `escalate`, tell the user to run `atlas-mcp resolve <receipt_id> approve`,
   then poll `atlas_receipt_status` until `ready`.
3. After acting, call `atlas_commit_effect` with what actually happened.
